00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.710
So, what we do is we just, for
the last two or three weeks,

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:02.890
we've had it running.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:04.830
This is all the spare pieces here.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:05.903
And we, this is what they look like

00:09:05.903 --> 00:09:07.603
when they come out of the printer.

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:09.750
- That's so cool.

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:13.380
- Yeah, and we just bang these
out and it's really cool.

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:15.130
And we give them the first responders

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.210
and who else, whoever wants them.

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.260
- That's really cool.

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:20.050
And I know you said it makes you feel good

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:22.260
and feel like you're
helping but you are helping.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.640
That's a really incredibly cool thing.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:26.310
You could be, like you said,
you could just be like a lot

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:29.110
of Americans are sitting at
home watching TV and eating.

